      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119773945151074637&text=Same%20psychology%20maybe%2C%20but%20not%20the%20same%20multiples.%20In%20power-law%20terms%2C%20cycle%20peaks%20have%20tended%20to%20land%20closer%20to%20the%20long-run%20trend%20each%20time%2C%20so%20I%27d%20read%20history%20as%20a%20range%2C%20not%20a%20repeat.%20The%20curve%20I%20use%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Fforecastquant%2Fstatus%2F2118779927340470279%20%24BTC",
      "source_post_id": "2118779927340470279",
