      "reply_with_suggestion": "https://x.com/intent/post?in_reply_to=2119776158174609837&text=Prior%20cycles%20not%20making%20new%20lows%20after%20this%20kind%20of%20break%20is%20a%20useful%20contrast%2C%20but%20it%27s%20a%20handful%20of%20cases%2C%20not%20a%20rule.%20With%20%241B%2B%20in%20longs%20flushed%2C%20I%27d%20watch%20whether%20spot%20demand%20holds%20the%20level%20without%20leverage%20doing%20the%20lifting.%20%24BTC",
